<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: center">&#160;<span style="text-transform: uppercase"><b>EXPLANATORY
NOTE</b></span></p>

<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-10-01to2025-12-31" id="Fact000038" name="dei:AmendmentDescription"><p id="xdx_806_edei--AmendmentDescription_zxn38iZQxbS" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: center"><span style="text-transform: uppercase"><b>&#160;</b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">Mobix Labs, Inc., previously
filed a Registration Statement on Form S-1 (File No. 333-287493) with the Securities and Exchange Commission (the &#8220;SEC&#8221;),
on May 22, 2025, as amended by Amendment No. 1 filed August 7, 2025, which was declared effective on August 11, 2025 (the &#8220;Prior
Registration Statement&#8221;). The Prior Registration Statement registered 15,373,309 shares of Class A Common Stock for resale by the
selling stockholders named therein.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">Mobix Labs, Inc. also
previously filed a Registration Statement on Form S-1 (File No. 333-290247) with the SEC on September 12, 2025, as amended by
Amendment No. 1 filed on October 10, 2025, which has not been declared effective (the &#8220;Subsequent Registration
Statement&#8221;). The Subsequent Registration Statement was filed to register 12,890,274 shares of Class A Common Stock for resale
by the selling stockholders named herein and an additional 1,000,000 shares of Class A Common Stock are being registered hereby.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">Pursuant to Rule 429 under
the Securities Act of 1933, the prospectus included in this Registration Statement is a combined prospectus relating to an aggregate
of 24,127,116 shares of Class A Common Stock, which consists of 10,236,842 shares of Class A Common Stock registered pursuant to the Prior Registration Statement and 13,890,274
shares of Class A Common Stock registered pursuant to the Subsequent Registration Statement. Accordingly, this Registration Statement constitutes a Pre-Effective Amendment to the Subsequent
Registration Statement and a Post-Effective Amendment to the Prior Registration Statement, and such Post-Effective Amendment shall hereafter
become effective concurrently with the effectiveness of this Registration Statement in accordance with Section 8(c) of the Securities
Act.</p></ix:nonNumeric>

<p id="xdx_813_zVMjterDNz09" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">&#160;</p>


<!-- Field: Page; Sequence: 2 -->
