    <p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">Up to 1,268,252 shares issuable upon exercise
    of warrants issued to our financial advisors; and</p>
    <p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"></p></td></tr>
