    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">James
    Peterson, Co-Founder 1,050,000 RSUs</span></td></tr>
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
