</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8AD_zFCjc6ioYiAd" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Amortization
expense related to intangible assets for the three months ended December 31, 2025 and 2024 was $<span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--AmortizationOfIntangibleAssets_pn3n3_c20251001__20251231_zikGfIdLngYl" title="Amortization of intangible assets"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AmortizationOfIntangibleAssets" contextRef="From2025-10-01to2025-12-31" id="Fact000825" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">406</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--AmortizationOfIntangibleAssets_pn3n3_c20241001__20241231_zdtn3WSGEJh" title="Amortization of intangible assets"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AmortizationOfIntangibleAssets" contextRef="From2024-10-012024-12-31" id="Fact000827" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">471</ix:nonFraction></span>, respectively. The weighted-average
remaining lives of intangible assets as of December 31, 2025 were developed technology <span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--AcquiredFiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsWeightedAverageUsefulLife_dtY_c20251001__20251231__us-gaap--FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsByMajorClassAxis__us-gaap--DevelopedTechnologyRightsMember_zxYKo2jkq5P5" title="Weighted-average remaining lives of intangible assets"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-10-012025-12-31_us-gaap_DevelopedTechnologyRightsMember" format="ixt-sec:duryear" id="Fact000829" name="us-gaap:AcquiredFiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsWeightedAverageUsefulLife">4.7</ix:nonNumeric></span> years; customer relationships <span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--AcquiredFiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsWeightedAverageUsefulLife_dtY_c20251001__20251231__us-gaap--FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsByMajorClassAxis__us-gaap--CustomerRelationshipsMember_zQFaBiKljvti" title="Weighted-average remaining lives of intangible assets"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-10-012025-12-31_us-gaap_CustomerRelationshipsMember" format="ixt-sec:duryear" id="Fact000831" name="us-gaap:AcquiredFiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsWeightedAverageUsefulLife">11.4</ix:nonNumeric></span> years;
and trade names <span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--AcquiredFiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsWeightedAverageUsefulLife_dtY_c20251001__20251231__us-gaap--FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsByMajorClassAxis__us-gaap--TradeNamesMember_z4P2FbUqRM4l" title="Weighted-average remaining lives of intangible assets"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-10-012025-12-31_us-gaap_TradeNamesMember" format="ixt-sec:duryear" id="Fact000833" name="us-gaap:AcquiredFiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsWeightedAverageUsefulLife">0.9</ix:nonNumeric></span> years.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

