<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Cash
paid for amounts included in the measurement of operating lease liabilities for the three months ended December 31, 2025 and 2024 was
$<span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--OperatingLeasePayments_pn3n3_c20251001__20251231_zwuWlHbUKcy7" title="Operating lease payments"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OperatingLeasePayments" contextRef="From2025-10-01to2025-12-31" id="Fact000987" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">103</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--OperatingLeasePayments_pn3n3_c20241001__20241231_zELTwrUsuS57" title="Operating lease payments"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OperatingLeasePayments" contextRef="From2024-10-012024-12-31" id="Fact000989" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">189</ix:nonFraction></span>, respectively. As of December 31, 2025, the weighted-average remaining lease term was <span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--OperatingLeaseWeightedAverageRemainingLeaseTerm1_iI_dtY_c20251231_zViG1u3G3nrg" title="Operating lease weighted average remaining lease term"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2025-12-31" format="ixt-sec:duryear" id="Fact000991" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseWeightedAverageRemainingLeaseTerm1">1.2</ix:nonNumeric></span> years, and the weighted-average
discount rate was <span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--OperatingLeaseWeightedAverageDiscountRatePercent_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20251231_z6w7fl1VeG42" title="Operating lease weighted average discount rate percent"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseWeightedAverageDiscountRatePercent" contextRef="AsOf2025-12-31" id="Fact000993" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">15.6</ix:nonFraction></span>%. There are no other leases that had not yet commenced as of December 31, 2025 that will create significant additional
rights and obligations for the Company. The following table reconciles the undiscounted cash flows to the operating lease liabilities
recorded on the condensed consolidated balance sheet as of December 31, 2025:</span></p>

