<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
Company classifies the earnout liability and the liability-classified warrants as Level 3 financial instruments due to the judgment required
to develop the assumptions used and the significance of those assumptions to the fair value measurement. No financial instruments were
transferred between levels of the fair value hierarchy during the three months ended December 31, 2025 or 2024. The following table provides
a reconciliation of the balance of financial instruments measured at fair value on a recurring basis using Level 3 inputs:</span></p>

