<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>&#160;</b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>MOBIX
LABS, INC.</b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>NOTES
TO CONDENSED CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>(unaudited,
in thousands, except share and per share amounts)</b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>&#160;</b></span></p>

</ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-10-01to2025-12-31" escape="true" id="Fact001404" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskDisclosureTextBlock"><p id="xdx_80C_eus-gaap--ConcentrationRiskDisclosureTextBlock_z3Bs1futuIwg" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: left"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>Note
16 &#8212; <span id="xdx_820_zkuevNh7BaC2">Concentrations</span></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><i>Significant
Customers</i></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">For
the three months ended December 31, 2025, three customers accounted for <span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--ConcentrationRiskPercentage1_pid_dp_uPure_c20251001__20251231__srt--MajorCustomersAxis__custom--ThreeCustomersMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--SalesRevenueNetMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_zZInmGa18Wk" title="Concentration risk, percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" contextRef="From2025-10-012025-12-31_custom_ThreeCustomersMember_us-gaap_SalesRevenueNetMember_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember" id="Fact001406" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">41</ix:nonFraction></span>% of the Company&#8217;s net revenue. For the three months
ended December 31, 2024, one customer accounted for <span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--ConcentrationRiskPercentage1_pid_dp_uPure_c20241001__20241231__srt--MajorCustomersAxis__custom--OneCustomerMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--SalesRevenueNetMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_z9kLPaEmQjuf" title="Concentration risk, percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" contextRef="From2024-10-012024-12-31_custom_OneCustomerMember_us-gaap_SalesRevenueNetMember_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember" id="Fact001408" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">67</ix:nonFraction></span>% of the Company&#8217;s net revenue. No other customer accounted for more than
<span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--ConcentrationRiskPercentage1_pid_dp_uPure_c20251001__20251231__srt--MajorCustomersAxis__custom--NoOtherCustomerMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--SalesRevenueNetMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_zCVxaeERNRi5" title="Concentration risk, percentage"><span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--ConcentrationRiskPercentage1_pid_dp_uPure_c20241001__20241231__srt--MajorCustomersAxis__custom--NoOtherCustomerMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--SalesRevenueNetMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_zNPEqdaDS109" title="Concentration risk, percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" contextRef="From2025-10-012025-12-31_custom_NoOtherCustomerMember_us-gaap_SalesRevenueNetMember_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember" id="Fact001410" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" contextRef="From2024-10-012024-12-31_custom_NoOtherCustomerMember_us-gaap_SalesRevenueNetMember_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember" id="Fact001412" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">10</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></span></span>% of net revenue in the respective periods.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">As
of December 31, 2025, three customers had balances due that represented <span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--ConcentrationRiskPercentage1_pid_dp_uPure_c20251001__20251231__srt--MajorCustomersAxis__custom--ThreeCustomersMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--AccountsReceivableMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_zy6mps2VVUA6" title="Concentration risk, percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" contextRef="From2025-10-012025-12-31_custom_ThreeCustomersMember_us-gaap_AccountsReceivableMember_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember" id="Fact001414" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">47</ix:nonFraction></span>% of the Company&#8217;s total accounts receivable. As of September
30, 2025, two customers had balances due that represented <span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--ConcentrationRiskPercentage1_pid_dp_uPure_c20241001__20250930__srt--MajorCustomersAxis__custom--TwoCustomersMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--AccountsReceivableMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_zYqBNHqhtnAf" title="Concentration risk, percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" contextRef="From2024-10-012025-09-30_custom_TwoCustomersMember_us-gaap_AccountsReceivableMember_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember" id="Fact001416" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">30</ix:nonFraction></span>% of the Company&#8217;s total accounts receivable.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

</ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-10-01to2025-12-31" escape="true" id="Fact001418" name="us-gaap:SegmentReportingDisclosureTextBlock"><p id="xdx_801_eus-gaap--SegmentReportingDisclosureTextBlock_zd8NKlQKL4xi" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: left"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>Note
17 &#8212; <span id="xdx_824_zBHwDISAvL01">Segment Information</span></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
Company operates as a single operating segment. The Company&#8217;s chief operating decision maker (&#8220;CODM&#8221;) is its Chief Executive Officer. All significant
operating decisions are based upon analysis of the Company as <span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--NumberOfOperatingSegments_dc_uSegment_c20251001__20251231_zfX8po0x2zY7" title="Number of operating segment"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:NumberOfOperatingSegments" contextRef="From2025-10-01to2025-12-31" id="Fact001420" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" decimals="INF" unitRef="Segment">one</ix:nonFraction></span> operating segment to allocate resources, make operating decisions,
and evaluate financial performance.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--SegmentReportingCodmProfitLossMeasureHowUsedDescription_c20251001__20251231_zP1jUCkrqdSf" title="Segment reporting, CODM, profit (loss) measure, how used, description"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-10-01to2025-12-31" id="Fact001422" name="us-gaap:SegmentReportingCodmProfitLossMeasureHowUsedDescription">The
CODM considers consolidated net income (loss) to be the measure of segment profit and loss for monitoring budget versus actual results,
performing variance analysis, and forecasting future performance.</ix:nonNumeric></span> <span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--SegmentReportingExpenseInformationUsedByCodmDescription_c20251001__20251231_zIl6AbVGZIw2" title="Segment reporting, expense information used by CODM, description"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-10-01to2025-12-31" id="Fact001424" name="us-gaap:SegmentReportingExpenseInformationUsedByCodmDescription">The CODM considers the impact of significant segment expenses on net
income, which are the same expenses presented on the condensed consolidated statements of operations and comprehensive loss when making
operating decisions.</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
measure of segment assets is reported on the condensed consolidated balance sheets as total assets. The CODM does not review segment
assets at a level other than that presented in the Company&#8217;s condensed consolidated balance sheets.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: left"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><i>Revenues
by Geographic Region</i></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-10-01to2025-12-31" escape="true" id="Fact001426" name="us-gaap:RevenueFromExternalCustomersByGeographicAreasTableTextBlock"><p id="xdx_89F_eus-gaap--RevenueFromExternalCustomersByGeographicAreasTableTextBlock_zad3GN9zqQv9" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
Company&#8217;s net revenue by geographic region, based on ship-to location, is summarized as follows:</span></p>

