<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>MOBIX
LABS, INC.</b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>NOTES
TO CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS (continued)</b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>(in
thousands, except share and per share amounts)</b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

</ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2024-10-012025-09-30" escape="true" id="Fact002343" name="MOBX:ReverseRecapitalizationTextBlock"><p id="xdx_802_ecustom--ReverseRecapitalizationTextBlock_zrcCM9x0TDja" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>Note
3 &#8212; <span id="xdx_823_zSg30Ux9RJTd">Reverse Recapitalization</span></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">As
discussed in Note 1, <i>Company Information</i>, the Closing of the Merger occurred on December 21, 2023. In the Merger, as provided
for in the Business Combination Agreement:</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"><tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
<td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.25in"/><td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#9679;</span></td><td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">All
                                            of Legacy Mobix&#8217;s <span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--CommonStockSharesIssued_iI_pid_c20231221__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--LegacyMobixMember__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__us-gaap--CommonClassAMember_zNYCNsHenRs1" title="Common stock shares issued"><span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--CommonStockSharesOutstanding_iI_pid_c20231221__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--LegacyMobixMember__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__us-gaap--CommonClassAMember_zF4iGQULpAEc" title="Common stock shares outstanding"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesIssued" contextRef="AsOf2023-12-21_custom_LegacyMobixMember_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember" id="Fact002345" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesOutstanding" contextRef="AsOf2023-12-21_custom_LegacyMobixMember_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember" id="Fact002347" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">18,139,258</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></span></span> issued and outstanding shares of common stock were cancelled
                                            and converted into the same number of shares of the Company&#8217;s Class A Common Stock;</span></td></tr>
<tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
<td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</td><td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</td><td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify">&#160;</td></tr>
<tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
<td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.25in"/><td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#9679;</span></td><td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">All
                                            of Legacy Mobix&#8217;s Founders Redeemable Convertible Preferred Stock and Series A Redeemable
                                            Convertible Preferred Stock, totaling <span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesConversionOfConvertibleSecurities_pid_c20231221__20231221__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--LegacyMobixMember__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__us-gaap--CommonClassBMember_zvlKBiT9iDmk" title="Conversion of notes into shares"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesConversionOfConvertibleSecurities" contextRef="From2023-12-212023-12-21_custom_LegacyMobixMember_us-gaap_CommonClassBMember" id="Fact002349" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">2,254,901</ix:nonFraction></span> shares, was converted into the same number
                                            of shares of the Company&#8217;s Class B Common Stock;</span></td></tr>
<tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
<td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</td><td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</td><td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify">&#160;</td></tr>
<tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
<td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.25in"/><td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#9679;</span></td><td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">All
                                            of Legacy Mobix&#8217;s convertible notes were converted into shares of Legacy Mobix common
