to the Closing, the Company paid $<span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionCostOfAcquiredEntityTransactionCosts_iI_pn3n3_c20250930_zNUYte1gV88b" title="Transaction costs"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessAcquisitionCostOfAcquiredEntityTransactionCosts" contextRef="AsOf2025-09-30" id="Fact002521" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">982</ix:nonFraction></span> of the Merger-related transaction costs and negotiated a $<span id="xdx_901_ecustom--ReductionOfUnpaidTransactionCost_pn3n3_c20241001__20250930_zycZ5kdLdtg2" title="Unpaid transaction cost"><ix:nonFraction name="MOBX:ReductionOfUnpaidTransactionCost" contextRef="From2024-10-012025-09-30" id="Fact002523" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">99</ix:nonFraction></span> reduction of the unpaid transaction
costs.</span></p>

