</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8A4_zYn9PoLSGyYk" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Depreciation
expense for the years ended September 30, 2025 and 2024 was $<span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--Depreciation_pn3n3_c20241001__20250930_zprkQbxbGB61" title="Depreciation expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Depreciation" contextRef="From2024-10-012025-09-30" id="Fact002723" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">366</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--Depreciation_pn3n3_c20231001__20240930_zgfEhL3NZSvg" title="Depreciation expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Depreciation" contextRef="From2023-10-012024-09-30" id="Fact002725" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">472</ix:nonFraction></span>, respectively.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">During
the year ended September 30, 2025, the Company recognized losses of $<span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--GainLossOnSaleOfPropertyPlantEquipment_pn3n3_c20241001__20250930_zBEdGd4n2qL7" title="Loss on disposal of assets"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:GainLossOnSaleOfPropertyPlantEquipment" contextRef="From2024-10-012025-09-30" id="Fact002727" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">472</ix:nonFraction></span> on the disposal of certain assets, principally consisting of equipment
and furniture and leasehold improvements, at a leased office the Company vacated. Such losses are principally included in selling, general
and administrative expenses in the consolidated statements of operations and comprehensive loss. During the year ended September 30,
2024, the Company wrote off certain tooling having a carrying value of $<span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--GainLossOnSaleOfPropertyPlantEquipment_pn3n3_c20231001__20240930_zL2GN1s0czgg" title="Loss on disposal of assets"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:GainLossOnSaleOfPropertyPlantEquipment" contextRef="From2023-10-012024-09-30" id="Fact002729" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">584</ix:nonFraction></span> which management determined it would not use in production.
The charge is included in &#8220;Research and development&#8221; in the consolidated statements of operations and comprehensive loss.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>


