</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8A0_zl6Hl6nflkE5" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
Company recorded amortization expense related to intangible assets of $<span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--AmortizationOfIntangibleAssets_pn3n3_c20241001__20250930_zwoof3hBKfqc" title="Amortization of intangible assets"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AmortizationOfIntangibleAssets" contextRef="From2024-10-012025-09-30" id="Fact002809" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">1,692</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--AmortizationOfIntangibleAssets_pn3n3_c20231001__20240930_zBWn74s6n9Eb" title="Amortization of intangible assets"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AmortizationOfIntangibleAssets" contextRef="From2023-10-012024-09-30" id="Fact002811" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">1,543</ix:nonFraction></span> during the years ended September 30, 2025 and
2024, respectively. The weighted-average remaining lives of intangible assets as of September 30, 2025 were developed technology <span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--AcquiredFiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsWeightedAverageUsefulLife_dtY_c20241001__20250930_zdMyDoIhvca2" title="Weighted-average remaining lives of intangible assets"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2024-10-012025-09-30" format="ixt-sec:duryear" id="Fact002813" name="us-gaap:AcquiredFiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsWeightedAverageUsefulLife">5.0</ix:nonNumeric></span>
years; customer relationships <span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--AcquiredFiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsWeightedAverageUsefulLife_dtY_c20241001__20250930__us-gaap--FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsByMajorClassAxis__us-gaap--CustomerRelationshipsMember_zIDADwLAPyc3" title="Weighted-average remaining lives of intangible assets"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2024-10-012025-09-30_us-gaap_CustomerRelationshipsMember" format="ixt-sec:duryear" id="Fact002815" name="us-gaap:AcquiredFiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsWeightedAverageUsefulLife">11.6</ix:nonNumeric></span> years; and trade names <span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--AcquiredFiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsWeightedAverageUsefulLife_dtY_c20241001__20250930__us-gaap--FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsByMajorClassAxis__us-gaap--TradeNamesMember_znRGTCnxqTE6" title="Weighted-average remaining lives of intangible assets"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2024-10-012025-09-30_us-gaap_TradeNamesMember" format="ixt-sec:duryear" id="Fact002817" name="us-gaap:AcquiredFiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsWeightedAverageUsefulLife">1.0</ix:nonNumeric></span> years.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">During
the year ended September 30, 2024, as a result of declining sales of AOCs and strategic decisions on investment across the Company&#8217;s
product groups, the Company tested the related long-lived assets for possible impairment. Based on this test, the Company concluded that
the carrying value of the AOCs asset group exceeded its estimated fair value, and the Company recorded an impairment charge of $<span id="xdx_900_ecustom--ImpairmentChargesOfFinitelivedIntangibleAssetsExcludingGoodwill_pn3n3_c20231001__20240930_zZBMEGCZ07y4" title="Amortization of intangible assets"><ix:nonFraction name="MOBX:ImpairmentChargesOfFinitelivedIntangibleAssetsExcludingGoodwill" contextRef="From2023-10-012024-09-30" id="Fact002819" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">1,333</ix:nonFraction></span>
to write down the carrying value of the long-lived assets (consisting of developed technology and customer relationships). The Company
estimated the fair value of the AOCs asset group using a discounted cash flow model.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

